<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="小耳朵·听世界播客订阅与收听成长记录" />
    <title>一路听见成长｜小耳朵·听世界</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/things/xiaoerdou/growth/styles.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#story">跳到成长故事</a>

    <header class="hero">
      <nav class="masthead" aria-label="页面导航">
        <a class="brand" href="/things/xiaoerdou/" aria-label="返回小耳朵·听世界项目页">
          <img class="brand-logo" src="/things/xiaoerdou/growth/assets/screenshots/podcast-logo.jpg" alt="" />
          <span data-site-name>小耳朵·听世界</span>
        </a>
        <a class="quiet-link" href="#story">查看成长轨迹 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </nav>

      <div id="top" class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-eyebrow>一段由每一次播放共同写下的旅程</p>
        <h1 data-title>一路听见<br />成长</h1>
        <p class="hero-intro" data-intro>
          从第一位听众，到越来越多双认真倾听的小耳朵。这里保存数字，也保存数字背后的相遇。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="signal-stage" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg class="signal-svg" viewBox="0 0 1440 320" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path class="signal-shadow" d="M-20 180 C100 180 100 180 180 180 C230 180 250 80 300 80 C350 80 370 250 420 250 C470 250 485 130 535 130 C585 130 600 205 650 205 C700 205 720 55 770 55 C820 55 835 260 885 260 C935 260 950 110 1000 110 C1050 110 1065 195 1115 195 C1165 195 1180 145 1230 145 C1300 145 1320 180 1460 180" />
          <path class="signal-line" d="M-20 180 C100 180 100 180 180 180 C230 180 250 80 300 80 C350 80 370 250 420 250 C470 250 485 130 535 130 C585 130 600 205 650 205 C700 205 720 55 770 55 C820 55 835 260 885 260 C935 260 950 110 1000 110 C1050 110 1065 195 1115 195 C1165 195 1180 145 1230 145 C1300 145 1320 180 1460 180" />
        </svg>
        <span class="signal-label">LISTENING, OVER TIME</span>
      </div>

      <div class="scroll-note" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span>
        向下翻阅
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="story">
      <section class="growth-overview" aria-labelledby="growth-overview-title">
        <div class="growth-overview-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="section-kicker">THE WHOLE CURVE</p>
            <h2 id="growth-overview-title">声音是怎样<br />一路走远的</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="growth-overview-copy">
            <p>两条线共用同一条时间轴，但分开使用各自的刻度：上面是累计播放，下面是订阅者。这样既能看到整体节奏，也不会用双轴制造误导性的比例。</p>
            <div class="chart-legend" aria-label="图表图例">
              <span><i class="legend-line legend-plays" aria-hidden="true"></i>累计播放</span>
              <span><i class="legend-line legend-subscribers" aria-hidden="true"></i>订阅者</span>
              <span id="growth-observation-count" class="observation-count"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="chart-frame">
          <p class="chart-mobile-hint">图表可左右滑动查看全部时间轴</p>
          <div class="chart-scroll" tabindex="0" aria-label="可水平滚动的播客增长图表">
            <svg id="growth-chart" class="growth-chart" viewBox="0 0 1040 650" role="img" aria-labelledby="growth-chart-title growth-chart-description"></svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="chart-source-note">数据来自同时清晰显示“累计播放”和“订阅者”的时间戳截图。只显示订阅数的纪念卡没有加入折线；全部 77 个可核对观测点可以在下方展开查看。</p>

        <details class="chart-data-details">
          <summary>查看全部图表数据与截图来源</summary>
          <div class="chart-table-scroll">
            <table>
              <caption>播客增长图表使用的全部截图观测点</caption>
              <thead><tr><th scope="col">时间</th><th scope="col">累计播放</th><th scope="col">订阅者</th><th scope="col">截图来源</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody id="growth-data-body"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section class="opening" aria-labelledby="opening-title">
        <p class="section-kicker">THE STORY SO FAR</p>
        <div>
          <h2 id="opening-title" data-section-title>每一个数字，<br />都来自一次真实的选择</h2>
          <p data-section-intro>
            有人按下订阅，有人听完一集，还有人把节目分享给家人。把这些时刻并排放在一起，我们终于看见声音怎样慢慢走远。
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="timeline" aria-label="播客成长时间线">
        <div class="timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
        <div id="timeline-list" class="timeline-list"></div>
      </section>

      <section id="empty-state" class="empty-state" hidden>
        <p class="section-kicker">READY FOR THE RECORD</p>
        <h2>截图就位后，故事会从这里开始。</h2>
        <p>把图片放进 <code>assets/screenshots/</code>，再按 README 的格式填写 <code>story-data.js</code>。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="closing" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
        <div class="closing-orbit" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="orbit-one"></span>
          <span class="orbit-two"></span>
          <span class="orbit-dot"></span>
        </div>
        <p class="section-kicker">TO BE CONTINUED</p>
        <h2 id="closing-title" data-closing-title>谢谢每一双<br />愿意听世界的耳朵</h2>
        <p data-closing-copy>这不是终点，只是一次回头看。下一段声音，仍在路上。</p>
        <img class="closing-logo" src="/things/xiaoerdou/growth/assets/screenshots/podcast-logo.jpg" alt="小耳朵·听世界节目标志" />
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <a href="/things/xiaoerdou/">← 返回小耳朵·听世界项目页</a>
      <span id="footer-year"></span>
    </footer>

    <script is:inline src="/things/xiaoerdou/growth/story-data.js"></script>
    <script is:inline src="/things/xiaoerdou/growth/chart-data.js"></script>
    <script is:inline src="/things/xiaoerdou/growth/chart.js"></script>
    <script is:inline src="/things/xiaoerdou/growth/app.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
